      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Person is an aggrieved person if they were a party to the communication or the communication was made on their behalf",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "is",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) For the purposes of this section, a person is an aggrieved person if, and only if:  (a) the person was a party to the communication; or  (b) the communication was made on the person’s behalf."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-165-ss-2-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person is an aggrieved person",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "0.5000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Person is an aggrieved person if they were a party to the communication or the communication was made on their behalf",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "and",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) For the purposes of this section, a person is an aggrieved person if, and only if:  (a) the person was a party to the communication; or  (b) the communication was made on the person’s behalf."
    },
